* Title:	    arm_biquad_cascade_df1_q15.c    
*    
* Description:	Processing function for the    
*				Q15 Biquad cascade DirectFormI(DF1) filter.    
*    
* Target Processor: Cortex-M4/Cortex-M3/Cortex-M0
